omen-needle_crone = The Graveyard Seamstress
omen-needle_crone-text = An old woman sits on a gravestone, lips pierced, a mouthful of rusty needles. In her lap lie other people's arms and heads, their hair already combed. "They rolled here by themselves, dearies. I'll sew one on, one thing at a time. The seam will be crooked: you will live, but not as you did."
